# Template-owned paths: `make self-update` (scripts/self-update.sh) brings these
# up to a newer oryx-overlay release with a 3-way merge per file, so your own
# edits to them survive unless they overlap the template's.
#
# Everything else is yours. layout/, custom/, oryx.conf and docs/ are never
# written, whatever this file says. To stop updates to a path listed here, add
# it to .oryx-overlay-keep instead of editing this file.
.claude/settings.json
.claude/skills/
.github/workflows/
docker/
modules/
scripts/
tests/
.dockerignore
.editorconfig
.gitignore
.oryx-overlay-manifest
.shellcheckrc
CHANGELOG.md
CLAUDE.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
LICENSE
Makefile
README.md
requirements.txt
